  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EA27/2016 Emergency and Early Recovery Assistance to the People Affected by Typhoon Haima (Lawin)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to emergency and early recovery activities for communities and families affected by Typhoon Haima (local name: Lawin) in the four ecclesiastical territories in Northern Philippines by providing immediate shelter, WASH and livelihood assistance, and emergency preparedness through institutional capacity building interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
